<description>The remote CentOS Linux 7 host has packages installed that are affected by a vulnerability as referenced in the RHSA-2020:5435 advisory.

  - Open-iSCSI rtslib-fb through 2.1.72 has weak permissions for /etc/target/saveconfig.json because     shutil.copyfile (instead of shutil.copy) is used, and thus permissions are not preserved. (CVE-2020-14019)

